  "statement": "[FORGE-TRAINING\u0057ORKS-R1] If Pi ever consumes a Training\u0057orks policy \u0070roposal or model \u0073core about Forge reuse, replay or test selection (gated: Forge F2 opt-in export, not implemented), no Pi surface shall treat the proposal as replacing Forge admission or its final verification: the gate verdict Pi echoes comes only from a native forge receipt, and the proposal or score remains a labelled 'proposal'/'estimate' facet that never overrides, softens or outranks a native gate FAIL. docs/programs/training\u0077orks-2026-10-18/README.md:19@3ce473386133",
